WEBVTT

00:06.130 --> 00:13.300
[Footsteps]

00:13.340 --> 00:18.180
[REINER] Me? Only thing
I want is to go back home.

00:18.210 --> 00:20.280
That's all I care about now.

00:22.150 --> 00:23.950
[BERTHOLDT] I joined the ranks
hoping for assignment

00:23.980 --> 00:25.520
to the Military Police.

00:25.550 --> 00:28.490
Tucked away in the Interior.

00:28.520 --> 00:32.090
What about you?
Why did you sign up?

00:33.460 --> 00:35.430
Why'd I join?

00:35.460 --> 00:38.330
I decided I have to kill them.

00:38.360 --> 00:40.500
I won't stop
till every single Titan

00:40.530 --> 00:42.400
is dead and rotting.

00:42.440 --> 00:45.640
Dead. Every last one.

00:59.790 --> 01:02.350
[REINER] You saw what those
monsters are capable of.

01:02.390 --> 01:06.920
And you still
want to take them on?

01:06.960 --> 01:09.290
I know you've
got what it takes.

01:09.330 --> 01:12.730
I can see it in you.
Am I wrong here?

01:16.100 --> 01:19.300
[Sniffs]

01:21.410 --> 01:26.480
[EREN]
Damn you! You traitors!

01:26.510 --> 01:31.350
[Roars]

01:39.090 --> 01:44.060
♪ Opening Song

03:21.080 --> 03:23.210
Eren!

03:29.990 --> 03:31.690
[MIKASA]
What's wrong with me?

03:31.720 --> 03:35.520
Why didn't I slice
their goddamn heads off?

03:35.560 --> 03:38.160
That was the perfect chance.

03:38.190 --> 03:41.630
Why did I hesitate? Why?

03:46.170 --> 03:47.540
[MIKASA]
That was it.

03:47.570 --> 03:50.300
There won't be
another opportunity.

03:58.110 --> 04:00.510
Move! Everyone!

04:03.250 --> 04:05.950
[SOLDIERS groan]

04:07.720 --> 04:11.030
It's got Ymir!

04:11.060 --> 04:14.530
[grunts] Oh, hell!
She's not the only one!

04:17.030 --> 04:18.370
[KEIJI]
Shit!

04:18.400 --> 04:20.570
[CHRISTA gasps]

04:20.600 --> 04:23.940
No. This isn't happening!

04:23.970 --> 04:26.470
How can Bertholdt...?

04:37.290 --> 04:40.150
Soldiers! Prepare to attack!

04:40.190 --> 04:42.460
The Colossal Titan
doesn't walk away from this!

04:42.490 --> 04:45.230
It's a threat to all mankind!

04:45.260 --> 04:48.260
Swarm and terminate!

05:09.420 --> 05:12.220
[KEIJI]
Freak's as slow as they say.

05:12.260 --> 05:14.220
[GOGGLES] Size is
all he has going for him.

05:14.290 --> 05:15.990
[MALE SOLDIER 32F] Compared to
Titans we're usually up against,

05:16.030 --> 05:18.230
this one's a piece of cake!

05:18.260 --> 05:19.630
[MOBLIT]
Simple!

05:19.660 --> 05:22.700
[HANGE] He's wide open!
Slice the nape!

05:24.330 --> 05:26.330
[Yells]

05:26.370 --> 05:27.970
[KEIJI]
What the hell?

05:28.000 --> 05:29.470
[MALE SOLDIER 32F]
It's too hot!

05:29.510 --> 05:32.370
Argh! All of you fall back!

05:38.980 --> 05:40.050
My hand!

05:40.080 --> 05:42.050
Water! We need water!

05:43.420 --> 05:45.350
[Gasps]
He's vanishing!

05:45.390 --> 05:48.260
I don't know.
Something's different here.

05:48.290 --> 05:50.120
The last time he disappeared,

05:50.160 --> 05:53.190
it was more or less
instantaneous.

05:53.230 --> 05:56.100
He's maintaining
his form to emit heat.

05:56.130 --> 05:58.400
I think he's
protecting himself.

06:02.140 --> 06:05.140
As long as he generates
steam our rigs are useless!

06:05.170 --> 06:07.540
What, what do we do?

06:07.580 --> 06:11.210
Now? Nothing. Except wait.

06:11.250 --> 06:14.380
Squads three and four take
position behind the target.

06:14.450 --> 06:15.980
Rashad has command.

06:16.020 --> 06:17.320
Got it!

06:17.350 --> 06:20.490
[HANGE] Squad two, stay put.
Lauda has command.

06:20.520 --> 06:22.490
[LAUDA]
Understood!

06:22.530 --> 06:24.690
[HANGE] How long he
can act like a blast furnace

06:24.730 --> 06:26.230
remains to be seen.

06:26.260 --> 06:28.660
But he'll come
out of there eventually.

06:28.700 --> 06:31.130
When he does,
we'll rush the big bastard.

06:31.170 --> 06:32.900
Listen up.

06:32.940 --> 06:35.070
I want you to forget about
taking them alive.

06:35.100 --> 06:38.210
Destroy them.
No second thoughts.

06:41.310 --> 06:42.510
You're with me.

06:42.550 --> 06:44.680
Right, squad one, look alive!

06:44.710 --> 06:47.720
We've got a date
with the Armored Titan!

06:49.250 --> 06:53.190
Christa! Conny!
Move further back!

06:53.220 --> 06:55.920
For now, just
take care of those two.

06:55.960 --> 06:58.530
Ymir, she--

06:58.560 --> 07:01.530
She's not dead.
It just isn't possible.

07:01.560 --> 07:05.270
I know it. Please save her!

07:05.300 --> 07:07.130
Don't worry.

07:07.170 --> 07:10.300
[CONNY] Hang on! What about
Reiner and Bertholdt?

07:10.340 --> 07:13.940
They're screwed! Neither one
of them has their ODM gear!

07:13.980 --> 07:14.980
I'm begging you,

07:15.010 --> 07:17.680
wherever they are,
bring them back!

07:17.710 --> 07:19.580
[Gasps]

07:47.440 --> 07:52.380
[EREN] Reiner.
You lying piece of shit.

07:52.420 --> 07:55.580
Going off on what it means
to be a soldier.

07:55.620 --> 07:58.450
Always talking about honor.

07:58.520 --> 08:01.990
Played us all for fools, huh?

08:02.020 --> 08:05.930
Combat training
must've been a joke to you.

08:06.000 --> 08:08.660
How much were you holding back?

08:11.100 --> 08:15.000
And here I took you
to be real stand-up guy.

08:15.040 --> 08:18.540
Calm under pressure.
Intensely focused.

08:18.570 --> 08:23.480
The sort of man who puts
his comrades before himself.

08:23.510 --> 08:27.310
Damn you. I'd have
given anything in the world

08:27.350 --> 08:30.150
to be half as strong as you.

08:30.190 --> 08:33.390
You were my hero.

08:33.420 --> 08:35.020
[MIKASA grunts]

08:37.530 --> 08:39.260
[MIKASA]
That did nothing!

08:43.470 --> 08:46.000
He barely flinched
when Eren hit him.

08:46.040 --> 08:49.000
And my blades
don't even make a dent.

08:51.110 --> 08:52.070
[Grunts]

08:52.110 --> 08:55.610
He's not like Annie.
His armor's head to toe!

08:59.250 --> 09:01.450
Eren!

09:05.250 --> 09:10.490
[EREN]
Hey, Reiner. Asshole.

09:10.530 --> 09:17.430
I don't know what kind of face
you're making right now...

09:17.470 --> 09:20.370
...but I hope you
miserable pieces of shit

09:20.400 --> 09:23.040
are pleased with yourselves.

09:23.110 --> 09:26.970
I bet I could scour through
the history of mankind

09:27.010 --> 09:30.980
and not find anyone
a fraction as evil.

09:32.410 --> 09:37.350
[MIKASA grunting]

09:37.390 --> 09:39.190
[EREN]
You should be erased.

09:39.220 --> 09:43.390
Trash like you
can't be allowed to exist.

09:43.430 --> 09:45.930
What was going
through your head?

09:45.960 --> 09:47.930
You disgust me!

09:47.960 --> 09:53.600
Just thinking about your face
makes my insides churn!

09:53.640 --> 09:56.140
You make me want to puke!

09:56.170 --> 10:02.040
You're a pest! A revolting,
oversized pest!

10:02.080 --> 10:06.250
And pests have to
be exterminated!

10:20.730 --> 10:23.200
[Groans]

10:26.270 --> 10:29.230
Hey, take it easy!
That hurt!

10:30.640 --> 10:31.800
We're just sparring.

10:31.840 --> 10:33.570
You're supposed
to hold back a little.

10:33.610 --> 10:35.110
If you want to hold back,
that's your business.

10:35.140 --> 10:36.970
I defend myself
assuming you're coming at me

10:37.010 --> 10:39.810
with everything you've got.
Otherwise, what's the point?

10:39.850 --> 10:43.150
Let's remember
I'm the girl. I'm weaker.

10:43.180 --> 10:45.280
I have to protect
my frail little body

10:45.320 --> 10:46.880
from the big bad man.

10:46.920 --> 10:48.220
What? Ha-ha, Annie.

10:48.250 --> 10:50.520
Very funny. You're a riot.

10:50.560 --> 10:53.020
Frail little nothin'.
I'm the one who just got

10:53.060 --> 10:55.690
shoved in the dirt, you know.

10:55.730 --> 10:57.630
Good point.

11:00.200 --> 11:03.200
[ANNIE] That last move wasn't
about who's stronger, okay?

11:03.240 --> 11:05.740
I was using a special
defense technique.

11:05.770 --> 11:07.140
Comes in handy
when your opponent

11:07.170 --> 11:10.140
has a few pounds on you.

11:10.180 --> 11:13.280
Trust me. You could
benefit from learning it.

11:13.310 --> 11:14.710
Sure, uh--

11:14.750 --> 11:17.210
What do you say we take
a break for now, though?

11:17.250 --> 11:21.590
[EREN groans]

11:21.620 --> 11:23.250
[ANNIE grunts]

11:23.290 --> 11:28.830
[EREN groans]

11:28.860 --> 11:33.030
Right. That's enough, Annie.
You can let go.

11:33.070 --> 11:35.730
Come on. I've barely
shown you how this works

11:35.770 --> 11:37.270
and already you're surrendering?

11:37.300 --> 11:39.140
There's a two-fold benefit here.

11:39.170 --> 11:41.270
Or don't you want to learn
how to talk to women?

11:41.310 --> 11:44.270
Fine! Whatever! Just
please stop strangling me!

11:44.310 --> 11:49.010
Ah. So you are interested
in what I can show you.

11:49.050 --> 11:51.020
[REINER groans]

11:52.890 --> 11:56.890
[REINER and EREN groan]

11:56.920 --> 11:59.590
Not really sure I wanna
know how you got here.

11:59.630 --> 12:01.690
[MIKASA]
Hey, Annie.

12:01.730 --> 12:05.200
Your technique seems
pretty solid.

12:05.230 --> 12:07.100
Teach me.

12:10.870 --> 12:12.900
[ANNIE]
I'm flattered, but...

12:12.940 --> 12:14.970
...it's a method
for normal people.

12:15.010 --> 12:18.780
So, why would  you ever need it?

12:18.810 --> 12:23.510
Still, I'm curious to know
if it works on animals.

12:23.550 --> 12:25.650
Let's find out.

12:25.690 --> 12:28.990
This is happening? Oh crap.

12:29.020 --> 12:31.860
Hold up! Are these two
actually about to fight?

12:31.890 --> 12:33.020
This is gonna be epic!

12:33.060 --> 12:35.130
--Who--? Who do we bet on?
--What d'you mean? Annie.

12:35.160 --> 12:36.690
What? Idiot!

12:36.730 --> 12:38.800
Dinner says Mikasa
wipes the floor with 'er!

12:38.830 --> 12:42.570
[REINER] Which one of 'em
you think's gonna win?

12:42.600 --> 12:44.270
Well, I...

12:48.840 --> 12:51.210
How should I know?

12:59.220 --> 13:02.590
[EREN]
Wait. How did that play out?

13:02.620 --> 13:05.790
And why's it coming to me now?

13:05.830 --> 13:10.760
Is this--? Is this my life
flashing before my eyes?

13:10.800 --> 13:14.800
So what? Who gives a shit?

13:14.830 --> 13:19.940
It's not like it matters.
Not when I feel like this.

13:19.970 --> 13:21.910
No! Back down!

13:21.940 --> 13:24.140
You can't win in a fistfight!

13:24.180 --> 13:25.980
Make a break for the wall!

13:26.010 --> 13:29.210
Eren, please! Don't be rash!

13:33.550 --> 13:37.550
[EREN TITAN roars]

13:37.590 --> 13:39.820
Eren!

13:39.860 --> 13:40.960
Oh, no!

13:40.990 --> 13:43.230
He's blinded by rage!

13:49.700 --> 13:51.170
[ARMIN gasps]

13:52.940 --> 13:55.040
[Gasps]

14:05.020 --> 14:06.880
What the hell is he doing?

14:06.920 --> 14:09.550
Wait, that-- Holy crap!

14:09.590 --> 14:12.090
That's Annie's technique!

14:12.120 --> 14:13.290
[EREN]
You know what?

14:13.330 --> 14:15.790
There's no telling what
you murdering hypocrites

14:15.830 --> 14:17.660
were trying to accomplish.

14:17.700 --> 14:19.300
But now that I think about it,

14:19.330 --> 14:23.970
your master plan seems
to have a few holes in it.

14:24.000 --> 14:26.240
Wanna eradicate humanity?

14:26.310 --> 14:30.940
Maybe next time don't teach me
how to kick your ass!

14:32.910 --> 14:35.910
It's working!
I've got him locked!

14:35.950 --> 14:38.950
There's still a chance!

14:40.950 --> 14:43.320
[Grunts]
I don't think so!

14:43.360 --> 14:45.620
[EREN TITAN roars]

14:46.630 --> 14:48.560
[MIKASA]
Eren!

14:48.590 --> 14:50.660
[EREN]
You're not going anywhere!

14:50.700 --> 14:54.100
[EREN TITAN roars]

14:54.130 --> 14:56.200
[Roars]

14:56.240 --> 15:00.270
[Roars]

15:00.310 --> 15:03.740
[Growls]

15:07.050 --> 15:08.710
He did it!

15:16.320 --> 15:19.990
[ARMIN] Eren!
Can you hear me? Run away!

15:20.030 --> 15:21.960
You've got to get
closer to the wall!

15:21.990 --> 15:23.760
They're trying to abduct you!

15:23.800 --> 15:25.700
We can't let them do that!

15:25.730 --> 15:30.070
Trust me. Escape is
our best option!

15:30.100 --> 15:32.770
You say that,
but Armin, come on.

15:32.810 --> 15:34.540
They're not just gonna
let us leave.

15:34.570 --> 15:40.180
[REINER TITAN growls]

15:40.950 --> 15:44.250
Both of you fall back! Now!

16:01.530 --> 16:03.100
[Gasps]

16:05.640 --> 16:09.870
[ALL groan]

16:09.910 --> 16:11.980
[Gasps]

16:14.280 --> 16:16.850
[KEIJI]
Nice one, Eren! Good call!

16:16.880 --> 16:18.780
Looks like he's
in control again.

16:18.820 --> 16:21.820
Yeah, but Reiner's
not just gonna let him go.

16:21.850 --> 16:24.920
You're right;
escape's impossible.

16:32.160 --> 16:33.730
[Gasps]

16:33.770 --> 16:35.930
What the hell?

16:38.570 --> 16:41.870
[HANNES] The Colossal Titan.
I knew it!

16:41.910 --> 16:46.240
Why'd he show up here
of all places?!

16:46.310 --> 16:49.310
What's going on with Eren?
Where is he?

16:49.350 --> 16:52.880
Uh. He and the others
are over that way!

16:58.190 --> 17:02.730
[HANNES] What? So I take it
that's his Titan form, huh?

17:02.760 --> 17:03.890
Listen up, Eren!

17:03.930 --> 17:05.600
If we're going
to get you out of here,

17:05.630 --> 17:07.160
you've got to
buy us some time.

17:07.200 --> 17:10.130
Stop Reiner dead in his tracks!

17:10.170 --> 17:11.940
Think you can manage
to break off his leg

17:11.970 --> 17:15.570
with another one
of those joint holds?

17:15.610 --> 17:17.940
Our blades don't
do much good against him.

17:17.980 --> 17:20.680
He can't be outmuscled,
but he can be outsmarted

17:20.710 --> 17:22.550
if you play it right.

17:22.580 --> 17:25.620
[EREN TITAN]
Mhmm.

17:25.680 --> 17:27.780
[Gasps]

17:27.820 --> 17:30.150
Oooooo!

17:33.690 --> 17:35.560
[ARMIN]
Mikasa! Take my blades.

17:35.590 --> 17:37.960
I want you to use them.

17:38.000 --> 17:40.030
I'm counting on you!

17:42.900 --> 17:45.140
[EREN] This is the one time
where running away

17:45.200 --> 17:47.670
guarantees victory.

17:47.710 --> 17:51.580
You guys are screwed for
letting us see your true colors.

17:51.610 --> 17:53.740
You've backed yourselves
into a corner.

17:53.780 --> 17:55.250
[Gasps]

18:05.290 --> 18:06.960
--What the--?
--He's fast!

18:06.990 --> 18:09.490
[REINER TITAN growls]

18:11.600 --> 18:14.970
[EREN] Shit! The leg!
Go for the leg!

18:17.040 --> 18:19.240
Don't let Reiner
pin you! Get up!

18:19.270 --> 18:21.070
Throw him!

18:21.110 --> 18:22.770
[EREN grunts]

18:24.980 --> 18:28.780
Dammit! There's too much
power behind his attack!

18:31.850 --> 18:34.120
Since when is he
so light on his feet?

18:34.150 --> 18:36.990
We're completely
and utterly useless!

18:37.020 --> 18:39.160
No. It's not feasible
that his body is

18:39.190 --> 18:41.760
as hard as stone
from head to toe.

18:41.790 --> 18:44.160
He couldn't move as fast
if that were the case.

18:44.200 --> 18:46.930
Warriors used to sheathe
themselves in armor.

18:46.970 --> 18:48.770
Way back in the olden days.

18:48.800 --> 18:50.570
They had to leave
certain sections uncovered

18:50.640 --> 18:52.170
for freedom of movement, though;

18:52.200 --> 18:56.910
like the armpits and groin
or the spot behind the knee.

18:59.750 --> 19:01.040
[REINER TITAN grunts]

19:01.080 --> 19:03.050
[EREN]
I can't dodge this.

19:03.080 --> 19:04.480
[Grunts]

19:04.520 --> 19:06.550
Well, if I'm
gonna get slammed...

19:06.590 --> 19:08.720
Bring it!

19:08.750 --> 19:11.020
There we go!

19:11.060 --> 19:14.260
You're mine,
you son of a bitch!

19:18.560 --> 19:20.830
[KEIJI]
Yeah! That's how it's done!

19:20.870 --> 19:25.200
[EREN] Got him! Now it all
boils down to strength!

19:27.110 --> 19:30.940
[EREN]
Damn it. I'm slipping!

19:36.850 --> 19:40.120
[MIKASA yells]

19:40.150 --> 19:42.520
[EREN]
Mikasa.

19:42.550 --> 19:44.290
Nice cut!

19:45.260 --> 19:49.560
[REINER TITAN groans]

19:49.600 --> 19:52.900
[EREN] Try fighting back
minus a leg!

19:52.930 --> 19:55.170
[EREN TITAN growls]

20:01.010 --> 20:02.510
You've got this!

20:02.540 --> 20:06.540
Go for it, Eren!
Rip the traitor's head off!

20:06.580 --> 20:09.080
Drag him out into the open!

20:11.720 --> 20:14.990
[EREN] I can win.
I can beat Reiner.

20:15.020 --> 20:17.220
He's going down!

20:17.260 --> 20:23.660
[REINER TITAN grunts]

20:23.700 --> 20:29.270
[Growls]

20:29.300 --> 20:31.130
Wha-- What's he--?

20:31.170 --> 20:32.940
Heh. Good luck, pal.

20:32.970 --> 20:35.540
You've got him! Keep it up!

20:35.570 --> 20:42.650
[REINER TITAN growls]

20:44.980 --> 20:48.120
[ARMIN]
What's he doing?

20:48.150 --> 20:50.750
Why would he stop here?

20:53.860 --> 20:56.130
[Roars]

20:56.160 --> 20:57.790
[Gasps]

20:57.830 --> 21:04.230
[REINER TITAN roars]

21:04.270 --> 21:05.700
[Gasps]

21:05.740 --> 21:09.910
Everyone be on guard!
He's calling for backup!

21:17.150 --> 21:19.650
No visual on
incoming Titans yet.

21:19.690 --> 21:21.850
He ain't got a chance in hell.

21:21.890 --> 21:25.060
Try screaming for help
without a head, asshole!

21:25.090 --> 21:27.690
[MALE SOLDIER 32A]
It's almost off!

21:27.730 --> 21:29.930
[CONNY]
Um, I don't like this.

21:29.960 --> 21:32.230
Had to be some reason
for that scream.

21:32.260 --> 21:37.330
[Squelching and cracking]

21:41.240 --> 21:45.080
What the--?
No, no, no, no, no!

21:45.110 --> 21:49.310
[REINER TITAN roars]

21:49.350 --> 21:51.650
[Cracking]

21:54.990 --> 21:56.650
[ALL Gasp]

21:57.690 --> 22:00.990
[MALE SOLDIER 32A]
Above you! Look out!

22:01.030 --> 22:02.960
[EREN Gasps]

22:09.230 --> 22:14.240
♪ Closing Song ♪
